    "description": "Cleartrip Hotels Ventures Solutions invites applications from qualified candidates for the position of Front Office Manager at our Chennai location. This role offers excellent career advancement prospects.\n\nAbout Cleartrip Hotels Ventures Solutions:\nCleartrip Hotels Ventures Solutions is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Handle guest complaints and resolve issues promptly\n• Manage reservations and optimize room revenue through yield management\n• Conduct regular guest satisfaction surveys and implement improvements\n• Manage procurement of hotel supplies and control operating costs\n• Monitor F&B service quality and maintain hygiene standards\n• Assist in menu planning, costing, and food festival coordination\n• Prepare daily operating reports and present to management\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Diploma or Degree in Hospitality Management\n• 10-15 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Event Management\n• Proficiency in Front Office\n• Proficiency in Crisis Management\n• Proficiency in GDS Systems\n• Proficiency in Sommelier Skills\n• Proficiency in F&B Service\n• Proficiency in Opera PMS\n• Proficiency in Food Safety\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Flexible working hours\n• Salary Range: 20 LPA - 40 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Chennai, Tamil Nadu, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Cleartrip Hotels Ventures Solutions!",
